	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Accept Sex Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Accept Sex]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Accept Sex Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	<<npcincr Whitney lust -20>>
	<<llust>>
	Whitney catches <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> breath, still pressed close. After a minute, <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> pulls away and climbs off of you.
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "alone">>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "finished">><</link>>
<<elseif $finish is 1>>
	Whitney pulls back with a sharp breath, jaw tight. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> shrugs and turns back to <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> rod. "Fine. Your loss."
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "idle">>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "finished">><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<npcincr Whitney dom -1>>
	<<ldom>>
	You manage to shove Whitney back, away from you. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> stumbles, catches <<nnpc_himself "Whitney">> on the railing.
	<br><br>

	"Fine." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> stares at you for a moment, then picks up <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> things and heads back down the pier without another glance.
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "finished">>
	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Refuse
Whitney pulls back, <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> grip tightening on you.
<br><br>

<<if dangerEvent() and C.npc.Whitney.lust gte 20>>
	"You don't get to stop that," Whitney says, <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> voice dropping. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> pulls you back against <<nnpc_him "Whitney">>.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Refuse Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	After a moment, <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> lets out a slow breath and loosens <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> grip. "Fine," <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> says, stepping back.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><<run stopFishingProp()>><</link>>
<</if>>


